<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador Jan consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Ecuador Jan consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in January, the National Statistics and Census Institute said Friday:</p>
<p>    Food				     5.99 pct</p>
<p>    Clothing				 2.15 pct</p>
<p>    Housing				  6.11 pct</p>
<p>    Others				   9.02 pct</p>
<p>    Total				    6.44 pct</p>
<p>((-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
</text>
